ber","description":"Timeout in seconds (optional, no default timeout)"}}},"constrainedSampling":{"type":"json_schema","strict":"prefer"}},{"name":"edit","description":"Edit a single file using exact text replacement. Every edits[].oldText must match a unique, non-overlapping region of the original file. If two changes affect the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead of emitting overlapping edits. Do not include large unchanged regions just to connect distant changes.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["path","edits"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to the file to edit (relative or absolute)"},"edits":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["oldText","newText"],"properties":{"oldText":{"type":"string","description":"Exact text for one targeted replacement. It must be unique in the original file and must not overlap with any other edits[].oldText in the same call."},"newText":{"type":"string","description":"Replacement text for this targeted edit."}}},"description":"One or more targeted replacements. Each edit is matched against the original file, not incrementally. Do not include overlapping or nested edits. If two changes touch the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead."}}},"constrainedSampling":{"type":"json_schema","strict":"prefer"}},{"name":"write","description":"Write content to a file. Creates the file if it doesn't exist, overwrites if it does. Automatically creates parent directories.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["path","content"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Path to the file to write (relative or absolute)"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"Content to write to the file"}}},"constrainedSampling":{"type":"json_schema","strict":"prefer"}}]}}
{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"【原始需求（使用者原文）】\nYou are an expert data analyst and you will answer factoid questions by referencing files in the data directory: `/app/data/`\nDon't forget to reference any documentation in the data dir before answering a question.\n\nHere is the question you need to answer: What is the fraud rate for in-person transactions for the year 2023?\n\nHere are the guidelines you MUST follow when answering the question above: Answer must be just a number. If a question does not have a relevant or applicable answer for the task, please respond with 'Not Applicable'.\n\nBefore answering the question, reference any documentation in the data dir and leverage its information in your reasoning / planning.\n\nWhen you have computed the final answer, write ONLY the final answer to `/app/answer.txt` (e.g. if the answer is 42, the file should contain just `42`).\n\n【目前交付物檔案（可以修改；若原始需求要求的交付物不存在，請依需求建立它）】\n- answer.txt\n\n【工作區裡的參考資料（可讀、不可改）】\n- contract.md\n- request.md\n- data/payments-readme.md\n- data/payments.csv\n\n【工作區邊界】所有操作僅限於當前工作目錄；交付物請在當前工作目錄建立或修改，請勿遍歷或讀取工作區外部目錄。\n【環境說明】本工作環境已安裝 scipy/numpy 等科學運算庫；需要的函式庫已安裝時請直接調用產出交付物，不得因草稿內過時的註解或文字假設套件缺失而手刻替代演算法；某套件是否可用，以實際 import 的結果為準。\n\n【逐條需求驗證結果（程式重算，非模型自評）】\n- [FAIL] R1（交付物：answer.txt）：What is the fraud rate for in-person transactions for the year 2023?\n  驗證結果：答案值與按公開規則對公開資料的重算不符；請依原始需求與工作區資料自行重算（期望值不在證據中）\n  可見反例：{\"deliverable_value\": \"0.00152745\", \"problem\": \"mismatch_with_recomputation\", \"rule\": \"cond_rate: data/payments.csv {\\\"where\\\": [{\\\"col\\\": \\\"shopper_interaction\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"POS\\\"}, {\\\"col\\\": \\\"year\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": 2023}], \\\"num_where\\\": [{\\\"col\\\": \\\"has_fraudulent_dispute\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": true}]}\", \"expected_in_evidence\": false}\n  【條件比率規則常見錯誤形狀（逐項檢查，請用按欄位名解析的程式計算）】其一：嚴禁用未錨定欄位的文字匹配（如 grep 子字串或 cut 按逗號切欄）直接數分子／分母行數——CSV 其他欄位（如雜湊編碼欄、電郵欄、另一布林欄）可能碰巧含目標子字串（如 POS、True 或年份字串），導致跨欄誤中而多算，甚至碰巧湊出與失敗草稿完全相同的錯誤比率。其二：CSV 引號欄若含逗號會讓裸逗號切欄錯位。請一律用 pandas 或 python csv 模組依精確欄位名過濾分母與分子後計算比率。\n- [UNKNOWN] R2（交付物：answer.txt）：Answer must be just a number.\n  驗證結果：此條目無可靠程式重算檢查器，依規則標為 UNKNOWN，不准以自評代替\n  可見反例：{\"unverified\": true}\n\n【必須保持成立的條件】\n（沒有已 PASS 的條目）\n只修上面的缺口，不要重寫不相關的部分；改完後所有必需條目都要能通過重驗。\n不要重複同一命令：一旦腳本依原始需求的過濾條件與公式算出了與失敗草稿（deliverable_value）不同的新結果（或獨立驗算一次確認無誤），請**立即先把新結果寫入交付物檔案（如 answer.txt）**；嚴禁因反例未顯示隱藏期望值（expected_in_evidence=false）而遲遲不寫交付物或反覆重跑單行驗證命令。\n【python 一行式紅線】`python -c` 只能執行小陳述；`;` 之後不得接 if / for / def / with 等複合陳述（例如 `data = read(); if data: print(len(data))` 會直接 SyntaxError，重試多少次都不會成功），且單行內不得放 `#` 註解（`#` 會把同行後續所有 `;` 語句與 `print` 全部註解掉而產生空輸出）。需要多分支驗證或加註解時，把程式碼寫成 .py 檔案後執行；工作區裡已有能算出結果的腳本時，直接執行該腳本。\n計算腳本一旦成功印出與失敗草稿不同的新結果，下一個動作必須是把結果寫入交付物檔案：腳本輸出即結果本身時，直接重定向寫入（例如 `python <計算腳本> > answer.txt`）；寫入交付物之前不要再執行任何驗證命令。"}],"timestamp":1794061508806}}
